          "from": "customer",
          "at": 1793016892000,
          "text": "Good day. I bought wireless earbuds for ₦18,500 and it stopped charging after one day. I wrote to your chat and the person told me to read your policy. I did not ask for a policy. I asked for help. Please fix this. Adaobi Nwankwo",
