        {
          "id": "B-m4",
          "from": "agent",
          "at": 1793017019000,
          "text": "Thank you for the video. I am sorry again for the wait. I have checked order TRV55120: it was delivered 2 days ago, inside the 7 day window. I will arrange a replacement, which ships within 2 working days of approval, or a refund paid within 3 working days if you prefer. I will email you by 4pm today with your choice confirmed.",
          "subject": "Re: Faulty wireless earbuds",
          "latencyMs": 40000,
