          "text": "I will arrange collection of the wrong item and send the correct A4 laser printer, model P200. I can give a goodwill credit up to ₦5,000, but I cannot decide a business loss claim. I have escalated your claim with a summary of the job, proof and amount to the Claims reviewer, who responds within 2 working days.",
